// Pending pointers, platform, reasoning, records, requests (SS1.2, SS2.5.2, SS4.9.1)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// A pending approval in the snapshot: the SS2.5.2 pointer shape plus the gated `itemId` when one
